<title>UK: LME copper eases on Escondida vote to end strike.</title>
<headline>LME copper eases on Escondida vote to end strike.</headline>
<text>
<p>COPPER - Eases by some $10 ahead of PM kerb on news that workers at Chile's Escondida mine voted to lift a two-week strike. But still well above day's lows.</p>
<p>ALUMINIUM - Touch easier, in tight range.</p>
<p>NICKEL - Holding on above $7,400. OTHERS - Mixed, quiet.</p>
</text>
